# Text files of the overlay that the build or its tests read as text. The
# root .gitattributes forces LF for source files only; without this, a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true on the runners) turns these into CRLF and the
# readers that split on "\n" see a trailing "\r" in every row.
*.tsv      text eol=lf
*.in       text eol=lf
*.desktop  text eol=lf
